{"id":"n32562-5-5","stage":2,"title":"깨뜨리다 · 打破","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32562-5-5-1","ko":"우리나라 선수가 또다시 세계 기록을 깨뜨렸대!","zh":"听说我们国家的选手又打破世界纪录了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리나라","meaning":"我们国家，我国","explanation":"우리나라：我们国家，我国","readings":[{"term":"우리나라","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70403","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리나라","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3"}},{"text":"선수가","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선수가","audio":"/audio/062c0ef0399c4fd03963.mp3"}},{"text":"또다시","meaning":"再次，又一次","explanation":"또다시：再次，又一次","readings":[{"term":"또다시","audio":"/audio/7193e732d449273ecbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52122","senseId":"1","lemma":"또다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또다시","audio":"/audio/7193e732d449273ecbe6.mp3"}},{"text":"세계","meaning":"世界","explanation":"세계：世界","readings":[{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62444","senseId":"1","lemma":"세계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}},{"text":"기록을","meaning":"纪录，达到，创造，实现","explanation":"기록：纪录，达到，创造，实现；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기록","audio":"/audio/6e8b375a38c1e33c5a54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32499","senseId":"2","lemma":"기록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기록을","audio":"/audio/a943dc65aa7c1915ce1f.mp3"}},{"text":"깨뜨렸대!","meaning":"打破，突破","explanation":"깨뜨리다：打破，突破；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"깨뜨리다","audio":"/audio/7be69fd41e80264c2c7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32562","senseId":"5","lem